# Copy to .env for local development.
#
# Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code, and any
# VITE_* value is baked into the built HTML/JS at build time - so treat these
# as public. Do not put API keys or secrets here.

# AdSense publisher ID, injected into index.html by the `adsense-loader` plugin
# in vite.config.ts. When unset, the AdSense script tag is dropped instead of
# shipping a broken `ca-pub-%VITE_ADSENSE_PUB%` placeholder.
#
# On Netlify: Site configuration -> Environment variables -> VITE_ADSENSE_PUB
# Changing it requires a redeploy, because it is read at build time.
VITE_ADSENSE_PUB=
